From a8d1b801f733c8c78021f7fa3ea9c14a5034d1cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rtynbirf <119601232+rtynbirf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:35:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(scroll-area): make viewport keyboard-focusable

The scroll-area viewport carries focus-visible ring styles but no
tabIndex, so in Safari/WebKit a scroll area whose content has no
focusable elements cannot take keyboard focus at all; axe-core flags
scrollable-region-focusable (WCAG 2.1.1/2.1.3, Level A) on
[data-slot="scroll-area-viewport"]. Chromium and Firefox already
expose the scroller to the keyboard; WebKit does not (shadcn-ui/ui#12567).

Set tabIndex={0} on the scrollable element in all four live registry
sources: bases/radix (ScrollAreaPrimitive.Viewport), bases/base
(Viewport), bases/aria (the scroll region is the root overflow-auto
div; props spread through it), and the legacy new-york-v4 source for
consistency. Generated artifacts under styles/ and public/r/ are left
to the registry build.

The component already renders focus-visible ring styles on the same
element, so keyboard focus visibility comes for free; mouse users see
no change. Interactive content inside the area already satisfies the
axe rule via focusable-content; the added tab-stop only covers the
static-content case.

Verified: ESLint clean on the touched files; tsc error list identical
before and after the patch (pre-existing project errors only, none in
the touched files); prettier-plugin-tailwindcss does not run in the
preparation environment (pre-existing, fails on untouched files too).

Fixes: #12567
Signed-off-by: rtynbirf <119601232+rtynbirf@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 apps/v4/registry/bases/aria/ui/scroll-area.tsx  | 1 +
 apps/v4/registry/bases/base/ui/scroll-area.tsx  | 1 +
 apps/v4/registry/bases/radix/ui/scroll-area.tsx | 1 +
 apps/v4/registry/new-york-v4/ui/scroll-area.tsx | 1 +
 4 files changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/apps/v4/registry/bases/aria/ui/scroll-area.tsx b/apps/v4/registry/bases/aria/ui/scroll-area.tsx
index eb1ecebf..3e171056 100644
--- a/apps/v4/registry/bases/aria/ui/scroll-area.tsx
+++ b/apps/v4/registry/bases/aria/ui/scroll-area.tsx
@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@ function ScrollArea({
         "cn-scroll-area relative [scrollbar-width:thin] [scrollbar-color:var(--color-border)_transparent] overflow-auto outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:outline-1",
         className
       )}
+      tabIndex={0}
       {...props}
     >
       {children}
diff --git a/apps/v4/registry/bases/base/ui/scroll-area.tsx b/apps/v4/registry/bases/base/ui/scroll-area.tsx
